# ONE canonical TOML implementation: the pkg_manager TomlParser (parse_toml)
# — the package system's parser — is the single authority for the driver's
# project manifests (load_project), lockfiles (parse_lockfile) and workspace
# manifests (load_workspace). The former hand-rolled line parsers are gone.
# The package-tree digest (hash_package_tree) and the archive-path
# pre-flight (validate_tar_gz_archive) are the package manager's — the
# driver consumes them for the path/git checksums and the registry
# extraction gate.
